  "description": "A WinUI 3 video renderer and view for Vonage's OpenTok Windows SDK (OpenTok.Client 2.34.1), so a WinUI or .NET MAUI app can display OpenTok video. The SDK's own renderers target WPF and Windows Forms, and its netstandard2.0 assembly — the one modern .NET resolves — ships none at all. Adds OpenTokVideoView, OpenTokVideoRenderer and OpenTokDispatcher. Requires x64: the SDK's native payload has no arm64 build.",
